# Logs
*.log
scanner-service/*.log

# Media uploads
wine-cellar/mediafiles/

# Secrets files
# NB: was a bare `*.txt`, which silently swallowed every new requirements
# file. The tracked ones only survived because they predate the rule.
*secret*.txt
*secrets*.txt
*token*.txt
*password*.txt
*credentials*.txt

# Claude Code
.claude/
